# Line endings: LF in the repository AND in every working tree.
#
# Without this, a fresh clone on Windows (core.autocrlf=true, the Git for
# Windows default, including on GitHub's windows runners) converts text files
# to CRLF on checkout, and two things break:
#
#   - internal/k8s/assets/*.tmpl and internal/{k8s,render}/testdata/*.golden
#     gain \r, so renders no longer match the LF strings the tests assert on
#   - scripts/dev.sh stops running under a POSIX shell
#
# text=auto still lets git detect binary content and leave it untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
